>Replacing a Fre-tool</SectionComponent>
<p>All fre-tools can be fully replaced at the third level, overriding both the default and definition levels.
This is done by implementing their respective <a
  href="/Documentation/Under_the_Hood/FreTool_Interfaces"
>interfaces</a>.</p>
<p>For the parser and unparser, replacement is currently the only supported form of customization.
More information on these interfaces can be found in the following documentation sections:</p>
